# a format 25 project, from before the tracks' inserts (format 26: TP_ITYPE, TP_I1..I3 after TP_KANALOG): saved by that
# build, for the migration's test (tests/scenarios/migrate.xy). Track 3 knit with analog 77 and a drive character,
# track 4 rayon with its Ops page set.
# Run by a format 25 build (3e46904): its loom_host tests/fixtures/make_v25.xy
wait 300
bpm 107
param 3 engine 0
param 3 kanalog 77
param 3 ctype 1
param 3 camt 90
param 4 engine 1
param 4 rops 2
param 4 rfb 30
wait 40
projsave 1 v25_test
storesave tests/fixtures/store_v25.bin
